      "writtenOn": "2021-02-12T19:42:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Jean and I synced offline and decided to abandon this particular approach and go with something else. \n\nNamely, if an app files a TRACK_DEFAULT request, we\u0027ll check if that\u0027s currently being tracked by a per-app default and if so, we\u0027ll create a duplicate request that mirrors the per-app default request except that the requestorId and messenger of the original TRACK_DEFAULT request will be used.\n\nThe idea here is that all the existing plumbing will continue to work as-is. We\u0027ll also have to do this again when the network preference policy changes.",
